{"asset_key":"ep1/env_story_11309680","episode":"ep1","category":"env_story","story_id":"11309680","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:1:1130968001:1":{"text":"听你这话说的！这么美丽又灵敏的动物，难道你就不喜欢吗？","source_cn":"听你这话说的！这么美丽又灵敏的动物，难道你就不喜欢吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x47CE7E47948B3ADC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1130968002:1":{"text":"实话实说，我一直觉得它是最能代表深红高原的动物，每个人都应该爱护它！","source_cn":"实话实说，我一直觉得它是最能代表深红高原的动物，每个人...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6DC6CAB27158112E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1130968003:1":{"text":"要不是我住在咸水镇，没地养，我早就从蛮血手里买一只回去了。","source_cn":"要不是我住在咸水镇，没地养，我早就从蛮血手里买一只回去了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7EDBDA54DEBE04F5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1130968004:1":{"text":"——你看对面那只小陆行鸟！跑着跑着就摔倒了，真可爱。","source_cn":"——你看对面那只小陆行鸟！跑着跑着就摔倒了，真可爱。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x993A7AAA6929145F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:赏金猎人扬尼":{"text":"赏金猎人扬尼","source":"赏金猎人扬尼","status":"source"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":5,"localized_text_count":4,"speaker_count":1}}